# ==============================================================================
# Shakthi Sivakumar Portfolio - EmailJS Gmail Integration Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Go to "Email Services" -> "Add New Service" -> Select "Gmail".
#    - Connect your Gmail account: ssshakthi1024@gmail.com
#    - Copy your Service ID (e.g., service_xxxxxxx) into VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID below.
# 3. Go to "Email Templates" -> "Create New Template".
#    - Subject: New message from {{from_name}} (Portfolio)
#    - Content:
#        Name: {{from_name}}
#        Email: {{reply_to}}
#        Message: {{message}}
#    - Settings:
#        To Email: ssshakthi1024@gmail.com
#        Reply-To: {{reply_to}}
#    - Copy your Template ID (e.g., template_xxxxxxx) into VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID below.
# 4. Go to "Account" -> "API Keys".
#    - Copy your Public Key (e.g., user_xxxxxxx or public_xxxxxxx) into VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY below.
# 5. Create a file named .env in the root folder and paste your keys:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_emailjs_service_id
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_emailjs_template_id
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_emailjs_public_key
